        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Glimmer would tease with a knowing look, â€œSo when are you gonna catch some baby fever, huh?â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œDisgusting.â€ Catra would sneer, always grateful it sounded like a joke.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œAww, but youâ€™re so good with them!â€ Bow would counter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And sheâ€™d smile, maybe flutter her lashes to get a laugh. If they took it as a joke it meant she could say it honestly, â€œIâ€™m too beautiful for jail.â€&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
